Description: A Featured tab before Explore, and open it first
 Explore can't show a short list of apps whole: it keeps five banners, and
 trims Editor's Choice to a multiple of six. So this adds a page of its own
 for the distribution's picks, every app with
 GnomeSoftware::DeploymentFeatured set to "patrone", in banners and tiles,
 as the first tab. It's where Software opens, goes back to and returns to
 when it's opened again. Alt+1 is Featured now, and Alt+2 to 4 the others.
Author: William Daugherty <31995458+billsecond@users.noreply.github.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-10-31
